flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Read A, B and C/]
    B --> C{A ≥ B?}
    C -->|Yes| D{A ≥ C?}
    C -->|No| E{B ≥ C?}
    D -->|Yes| F[/Print A is the greatest/]
    D -->|No| G[/Print C is the greatest/]
    E -->|Yes| H[/Print B is the greatest/]
    E -->|No| I[/Print C is the greatest/]
    F --> J([Stop])
    G --> J
    H --> J
    I --> J
